  "body": "Closes #1750, by settling on the Firefox/Edge behavior. There is a\nseparate issue of defining the \"starting value\" concept correctly; that\nis #1911.\n\n/cc @upsuper @tkent-google @cdumez, although perhaps we should keep discussions in #1750 instead of here.\n\nWeb platform tests at https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/3991. Will fire browser bugs on Chrome and WebKit if they are happy with this change.\n\nMarking \"do not merge yet\" until we get some sign-off from Chrome and WebKit in #1750 or here.\n",
